  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>When an alpha particle is emitted from nucleus the nucleus loses two proton and two neutrons. This means the atomic mass number decreases&nbsp;by 4 and the atomic number decreases&nbsp;by 2.</p><p>In beta decays, the mass number of the atoms remains the same, but the atomic number changes: the atomic number increases in the negative beta decay and decreases in the positive beta decay by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>, respectively.</p><p>In gamma&nbsp;decay, mass number and atomic number remains unchanged.</p><p>Step by step variation is given below:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mo>&#160;</mo><mprescripts></mprescripts><mn>84</mn><mn>218</mn></mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mover><mmultiscripts><mo>&#160;</mo><mprescripts></mprescripts><mn>82</mn><mn>214</mn></mmultiscripts><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></mover><mmultiscripts><mo>&#160;</mo><mprescripts></mprescripts><mn>83</mn><mn>214</mn></mmultiscripts><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mi>&#947;</mi></mover><mmultiscripts><mo>&#160;</mo><mprescripts></mprescripts><mn>83</mn><mn>214</mn></mmultiscripts><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mover><mmultiscripts><mo>&#160;</mo><mprescripts></mprescripts><mn>81</mn><mn>210</mn></mmultiscripts><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mover><mmultiscripts><mo>&#160;</mo><mprescripts></mprescripts><mn>80</mn><mn>210</mn></mmultiscripts><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi></mover><mmultiscripts><mo>&#160;</mo><mprescripts></mprescripts><mn>80</mn><mn>210</mn></mmultiscripts><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></math></p>",
